{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19659","headline":"蕃中拘留岁余回至陇石先寄城中亲故 · 吕温","name":"蕃中拘留岁余回至陇石先寄城中亲故","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蓬转星霜改，兰陔色养违。\n穷泉百死别，绝域再生归。\n镜数成丝发，囊收擦血衣。\n酬恩有何力，秖弃一毛微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}